    <string name="mechanism_body">Some affected apps may decide whether to expose normal nodes based on the implementation class name of an enabled service. This plugin contains the experimental compatibility class name required by its current support profiles: com.google.android.accessibility.selecttospeak.SelectToSpeakService. It is not Google Select to Speak and is not affiliated with Google. AutoJs6 still reads and acts on nodes through its own accessibility service.</string>
    <string name="mechanism_title">Compatibility mechanism</string>
    <string name="navigation_back">Back</string>
    <string name="plugin_description">Optional experimental companion that may help AutoJs6 retrieve accessibility nodes from supported apps. It runs locally, ignores every event, and does not guarantee nodes on every page</string>
